(:taskCollection
  :id "Phase443TestCoverageCampaign"
  :createdAt 1789139928551
  :status "planned"
  :priorityOrder 7
  :summary "Test Coverage Campaign: raise coverage where a missing case kind is a defect rather than a gap, using the twelve kinds in docs/TEST_CASE_CATALOG.md. Each area declares its required kinds; a suite covering only the happy path is rejected at review."
  :phase "Phase443TestCoverageCampaign"
  :baseline "2026-09-11: no coverage tooling exists; over half of declared assertions never execute so any coverage figure today is fiction; the corpus holds 1029 negative assertions, so diversity is uneven rather than absent and its distribution is unmeasured. Areas below were selected because a missing case kind there is a defect already observed, not a hypothetical."
  :method "Ordering is forced: Task43601 must land first, because a suite that cannot execute cannot be shown non-vacuous, and Task44208 must land second, because an implementer cannot be asked to raise coverage without a map of what is uncovered. Every case is proven able to fail by inverting one assertion and recording the non-zero exit."
  :catalog "docs/TEST_CASE_CATALOG.md"
  :tasks [
    (:task
      :id "Task44301"
      :parentId ""
      :phase "phase-443"
      :title "Path boundary and workspace visibility"
      :kind :verification
      :lane "boundary"
      :state :planned
      :priority :critical
      :ownerRole "implementer"
      :createdAt 1789139928551
      :updatedAt 1789139928551
      :motivation "This is the area where a missing case kind is a security defect rather than a quality gap: measured 2026-09-11, a sibling directory sharing the workspace prefix was readable and a canonical in-tree path containing dot-dot was refused. Neither behaviour had any test."
      :purpose "Cover is_safe_path and the visibility tiers with adversarial and negative cases, not only happy paths: sibling prefix, traversal, symlink escape, canonical dot-dot inside, registered worktree, declared scratch root, and the tier reported in the receipt."
      :context (:contractRef D81PlanContext)
      :outcomes ["Required case kinds present and executing for every exported symbol of this area" "Each new case proven non-vacuous by assertion inversion recorded in the trace"]
